text='# All 31 current instruction paths\n\nEvery row is candidate-source analysis under `source-sha256.json`; no row asserts deployed-original equivalence. Entry/body/context coordinates refer to saved unchanged source.\n\n|Instruction and body/context|Authorization and account checks|Effects and failure order|Limits/applicability|\n|---|---|---|---|\n'
